THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This licence covers the source code in this repository. It does not cover the
pretrained model weights or the datasets, which are fetched at build time and
carry their own terms. None of them are redistributed here.

  InsightFace buffalo_l (SCRFD detection, ArcFace w600k_r50 recognition)
    The insightface library is MIT licensed, but its pretrained models are
    not covered by that licence: the project states its models are available
    for non-commercial research purposes only. This prototype is research,
    which is why it can use them. A commercial deployment cannot, and would
    need either the authors' permission or a differently licensed model.
    Fetched by ml-service/setup_models.py.
    https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface

  MediaPipe Face Landmarker
    Apache Licence 2.0. Fetched by ml-service/setup_models.py.
    https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe

  Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing (MiniFASNetV1SE, MiniFASNetV2)
    Apache Licence 2.0, Copyright (c) 2020 Minivision Technology.
    Fetched and converted to ONNX by ml-service/setup_pad_models.py.
    https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing

  Labeled Faces in the Wild (LFW), funneled
    Used for benchmarking only, never redistributed. Downloaded by the
    instructions in benchmark-data/README.md.
    https://vis-www.cs.umass.edu/lfw/
    Huang, Ramesh, Berg and Learned-Miller, University of Massachusetts
    Amherst, Technical Report 07-49, October 2007.
